					"local_notes": "Source construction: Night Blindness\nNative library match: Basic Set/Basic Set Traits (Basic Set Traits.adq). Fan source stated -10 point(s); library calculation is -10. Library note: If the vision or combat penalty for poor lighting is between -1 and -4 for most people, your penalty is the worse of double the usual penalty or -3. If the usual penalty is -5 or worse, you function as though you were completely blind. If you have Acute Vision, it only applies in situations with no darkness penalty.",
